      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Charles Bernard Day is a United States magistrate judge and former nominee for a United States district judge position on the United States District Court for the District of Maryland. He was born in Dothan, Alabama, and his nomination faced opposition from Republican senators."</data>
